  "Scripture source: the Indian Revised Version (IRV Hindi, CC BY-SA 4.0), parsed from the ebible mirror's USX (gracious-tech/fetch_collection, bibles/hin_irv), all 66 books, with section headings, notes and the IRV's 15 trailing cross-reference parentheses stripped. Translators looked up every quotation (cited or not) in that verse file and copied the bytes by script.",
